---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — mazetick"
  description="How to reach mazetick. Corrections to published measurements are especially welcome."
>
  <h1 class="display title">Contact</h1>

  <div class="prose body">
    <p>
      Email <a href="mailto:hello@mazetick.com">hello@mazetick.com</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      There is deliberately no contact form here. A form would mean processing your
      message through this site and would change what the
      <a href="/privacy">privacy page</a> has to say. Email reaches us directly.
    </p>

    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      If a number on this site is wrong, that is the most useful thing you can tell
      us. Quote the page and the figure. Every published measurement carries its
      sample size, window and method so that it can be argued with.
    </p>

    <h2>What we cannot help with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Selections, tips or "who do you fancy". We do not give them — see
        <a href="/about">about</a> for why.
      </li>
      <li>
        Account problems with a bookmaker or an exchange. We have no relationship with
        any of them and no ability to intervene.
      </li>
      <li>
        Gambling harm. Please use the free, confidential help on the
        <a href="/responsible-gambling">responsible gambling</a> page — the National
        Gambling Helpline is 0808 8020 133, 24 hours.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .title { font-size: var(--fs-display-l); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  .body { margin-top: var(--sp-8); }
</style>
